### 1. Register a Fresher
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fresher Test",
  "email": "fresher@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "FRESHER",
  "skills": ["React", "TypeScript"]
}

### 2. Login as Fresher (Copy Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fresher@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get Matches for a Job (Requires Fresher Token)
# Replace :jobId with an actual Job ID from your database
GET http://localhost:5000/api/match/:jobId
Authorization: Bearer paste_fresher_token_here

### 4. Send a Referral Request (Requires Fresher Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/referrals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_fresher_token_here

{
  "jobId": "replace_with_job_id",
  "referrerId": "replace_with_professional_id",
  "message": "Hi, I noticed you work at this company and I have the required React skills. I would love a referral!"
}

### 5. Login as the Professional/HR (Copy Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hr@testcompany.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 6. View Received Referrals (Requires Professional Token)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/referrals/my-referrals?type=received
Authorization: Bearer paste_professional_token_here

### 7. Accept the Referral (Requires Professional Token)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/referrals/:referralId/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer paste_professional_token_here

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED",
  "responseMessage": "Looks good! I will submit your profile into the portal today."
}
